# Doubling Chant's search is a "may": the player declines the one same-named
# card, nothing is chosen and the library keeps its Grizzly Bears.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 G
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 8
queue cardchoice none
resolvestack
